 ### Added
 
+- **Named-route discovery for PHP Workbench.** The route picker can list statically known names, URLs and parameters and resolve a selection to every matching registration without running Laravel. Contributed by PHP Workbench (local downstream build).
+
 - **Type-aware value suggestions.** Compatible variables appear first in direct returns, typed arrow bodies and declared property assignments. Other variables remain available, and nested arrays, concatenations and untyped closures keep their normal ordering. Contributed by PHP Workbench (local downstream build).
 
 - **Type-aware argument suggestions.** Compatible variables are shown before other local variables while entering function and method arguments. Contributed by PHP Workbench (local downstream build).
